# AWS Three-Tier Architecture

## Technologies Used
- AWS EC2
- VPC
- Public & Private Subnets
- Internet Gateway
- NAT Gateway
- Application Load Balancer
- Auto Scaling
- RDS MySQL
- Security Groups
- Terraform
- Docker
- Git

## Architecture

Client
↓
Application Load Balancer
↓
EC2 Auto Scaling Group
↓
RDS MySQL

## Deployment

```bash
terraform init
terraform plan
terraform apply
```

